Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 07:24:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] test(saas): cover AuthService (49% -> 92%)

- Add tests/saas/test_auth.py: 39 tests covering sgr/saas/auth.py's
  AuthService (password hashing/strength, JWT access+refresh tokens,
  TOTP 2FA, register_user/login/setup_2fa/enable_2fa).
- Password/JWT/TOTP helpers are exercised with real passlib/
  python-jose/pyotp roundtrips (all installed in this environment)
  rather than mocked, since real hash->verify / encode->decode /
  generate->verify cycles catch actual crypto regressions that mock
  chains would hide.
- register_user()/login()/setup_2fa()/enable_2fa() are isolated with
  AsyncMock/MagicMock doubles for get_repositories()/get_session(),
  matching the established pattern in tests/unit/test_event_bus.py
  and tests/exchanges/test_ccxt_base.py for modules with external
  infra dependencies (DB in this case).
- Remaining uncovered lines (14) are ImportError branches for
  optional dependencies (passlib/python-jose/pyotp not installed) -
  not exercised since all three are installed in this environment;
  consistent with similar unreachable-in-this-env branches already
  accepted elsewhere in the codebase.
- No production code changes. Full suite verified green: 1111
  passed, 9 skipped, 0 failed. Coverage 89.96% -> 90.96%. ruff
  unchanged (22, pre-existing). mypy sgr/ unchanged (118,
  pre-existing).
